	<section id="index_header">
		
  <div id="index_header_text_wrapper"> 
    <div id="index_header_text"> 
      <h1><img src="./index/_img/ttl_index_header.png" alt="NIES collection"></h1>
      <p>Culture strains of cyanobacteria, eukaryotic microalgae, protozoa and 
        endangered algae are maintained in the Microbial Culture Collection at 
        the National Institute for Environmental Studies (NIES Collection, Tsukuba, 
        JAPAN). These strains are available for educational,research and developmental 
        purposes. NIES Collection accepts the deposition of strains, which are 
        important for environmental as well as basic and applied researches.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
	</section>	
